{"product_id":"help-im-stuck-in-a-giant-nostril-6-george-brown-class-clown","title":"Help! I'm Stuck in a Giant Nostril! #6 (George Brown, Class Clown)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDespite George's best efforts to rid himself of the curse of the burps, those magical and pesky belches are still following him everywhere he goes - even on his class trip to the science museum. If circulating through a human heart or sliding down the nostril of a giant nose sound wild, just wait until the burps attack! The sixth book in the George Brown, Class Clown series promises young readers, boys and girls alike, a whole lot of laughs.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Nancy E. Krulik\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780448455747\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738323476633,"sku":"16RA-1-9780448455747","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9780448455747_b2a792a0-441c-48dc-88ff-cbc96535428c.jpg?v=1758617084","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/help-im-stuck-in-a-giant-nostril-6-george-brown-class-clown","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}